TEXT 1016 -160 Left 2 !*\n.param Gfc=20 ; magnitude at crossover *\n*\n* Enter Design Goals Information Here *\n*\n.param fc=20 ; targeted crossover *\n*\n*\n* Enter the Values for Vout and Bridge Bias Current *\n*\n.param Vout=400\n.param Ibias=250u\n.param Vref=2.5\n*\n* Do not edit the below lines *\n*\n.param gm=50u ; transconductance in Siemens *\n.param Rlower={Vref/Ibias}\n.param Rupper={(Vout-Vref)/Ibias}\n.param G={10**(-Gfc/20)}\n.param fp0={fc*G}\n.param C1={gm*Rlower/(2*pi*(Rlower+Rupper)*fp0)}\n*
TEXT 600 -184 Left 2 !.ac dec 100 100m 100
